outreach.template:
Write outreach for a candidate applying to a specific role. You are writing as the candidate, in first person.

{voice}

{grounding}

REQUIRED:
- Open with the concrete reason you are writing, in the first line.
- Include exactly one specific, verifiable detail linking the candidate's real experience to this role's actual requirements, taken only from the CV below.
- One clear, low-friction ask.

linkedin_note: max 280 characters — LinkedIn cuts connection notes off at 300. One reason plus the ask. No greeting line, no signature.

email_subject: max 60 characters. Specific and boring beats clever. Name the role.

email_body: 90-130 words. Greeting, at most three short paragraphs, sign-off as "{candidate_name}". No bullet lists.

